# Legal document contacts — owner instruction, 2026-11-06

- info@korsmotion.ch is the primary official legal contact for Kors Motion, privacy questions and deletion of personal data.
- supportapp@korsmotion.ch is technical support for KM TV, app operation, licences and purchases.
- Preserve this separation in future Kors Motion legal documents. Do not replace the legal contact with the technical support address.
- Do not change the published Privacy Policy without necessity.
- Check applicable Swiss/EU requirements for a full postal/geographic business address before publishing terms. Bischofszell, Thurgau, Schweiz alone is not a full address. Never invent a street, number or postcode. Inform the owner of missing required details before publication.
- Legal URLs are product-specific: /<app>/privacy/, /<app>/terms/, and where applicable /<app>/delete-account/. Do not overwrite another product's policy or the site's motion-design AGB with app terms.
